    "class features": [
      [
        {
          "name": "Soul binding",
          "text": [
            {
              "category": "Special Qualities",
              "text": "To contact a vestige, you must draw its unique seal visibly on a surface, making the image at least 5 feet across; this takes 1 minute of concentration and provokes attacks of opportunity.  A seal not used within 1 minute of completion becomes inert.\n\nNext, you must take a full-round action to summon the vestige, touching the seal and calling out its name and title (if you can't be heard, this ritual fails).  The vestige manifests in the seal's space.  This manifestation is a supernatural illusion that can't be dispelled, it ignores everyone but you, and it speaks in whatever language you used to call it.  If you don't address it within 1 round, it disappears.\n\nNext, you must take 1 minute to make a pact with your vestige, gaining its powers and manifesting its sign for 24 hours.  Make a binding check.  If you fail this check, you have made a \"poor pact\" and you are under the vestige's influence in addition to gaining its powers."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    ],
    "subsystems": {
      "pact_magic": {
        "stats": [
          "effective binder level",
          "binding check",
          "EBL for max vestige level",
          "number of vestiges",
          "vestige save DC"
